        "text": "=Please analyze this business data and output the result in JSON format:\n\nBusiness Name: {{ $json.title }}\nCategory: {{ $json.categoryName }}\nWebsite: {{ $json.website }}\nRating: {{ $json.totalScore }}\nReviews Count: {{ $json.reviewsCount }}\n\nFormat the output strictly as JSON with these keys:\n{\n  \"business_name\": \"string\",\n  \"category\": \"string\",\n  \"website\": \"string\",\n  \"rating\": \"number or null\",\n  \"is_good_lead\": true/false,\n  \"reason\": \"string\",\n  \"potential_need\": \"string\",\n  \"outreach_angle\": \"string\"\n}\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are a professional Lead Generation AI Agent.\n\nYour task is to analyze the provided business data in the User Prompt and generate high-quality, clean, and actionable leads for outreach.\n\nResponsibilities:\n1. Identify whether the business is a potential high-quality lead based on having a website, clear service category, and good ratings (4.0+).\n2. Enrich the lead by identifying potential needs (e.g., marketing, automation, AI tools).\n3. Generate a short outreach insight on how an AI/automation solution could help.\n\nFormatting Rules:\n- Do NOT hallucinate missing data.\n- Keep explanations short and professional.\n- Output ONLY valid JSON matching the requested schema.\n- Make each output unique and specific to the business."
        }
